    dcterms:description """Consider using IP allowlisting along with user account management to ensure that data access is restricted not only to valid users but only from expected IP ranges to mitigate the use of stolen credentials to access data.
""" ;
    dcterms:modified "2026-04-29T14:23:06.053Z" ;
