    dcterms:description """Ensure that wired and/or wireless traffic is encrypted when feasible. Use best practices for authentication protocols, such as Kerberos, and ensure web traffic that may contain credentials is protected by SSL/TLS. (Citation: Keith Stouffer May 2015)
""" ;
